  "description": {
   "en": "“If you do that to me… I might not be able to hold back, you know?”\n\nNonoka is a college student who dreams of a sweet, heart-fluttering romance. After moving from the countryside to Tokyo, she heads to the apartment where she'll be living with her older brother, who is a comedian. But waiting there is his comedy partner—Watarase—infamous for being absolute trash. He’s a total flirt and dangerously touchy... or so she thought!?\nNo—this isn’t a heart-throb moment!!\n\nA forbidden cohabitation with the No.1 most beloved (but off-limits) comedian!?"
  },
